# ---------------------------------------------------------------- writing: the layout
layout is operation
layout purpose "Lay digits out as Python's repr does, at a position of a text, and give the position after them: with an exponent when the decimal exponent is -4 or less or above 16, otherwise with a point"
layout invariant none
layout typeParameter none
layout input target machine.Address copied
layout input start Int64 copied
layout input digits machine.Address copied
layout input count Int64 copied
layout input point Int64 copied
layout output Int64
layout outputOwnedBy none
layout raises none
layout effect use machine.memory
layout uses memoryAccess
layout memoryHeap false
layout async false
layout maxRecursion none
layout label begin loopKind none
layout label begin within none
layout label exponentForm loopKind none
layout label exponentForm within none
layout label fraction loopKind none
layout label fraction within none
layout label exponent loopKind none
layout label exponent within none
layout label minusSign loopKind none
layout label minusSign within none
layout label plusSign loopKind none
layout label plusSign within none
layout label twoDigits loopKind none
layout label twoDigits within none
layout label leadingZero loopKind none
layout label leadingZero within none
layout label powerDigits loopKind none
layout label powerDigits within none
layout label fixedForm loopKind none
layout label fixedForm within none
layout label leadingFraction loopKind none
layout label leadingFraction within none
layout label wholeDigits loopKind none
layout label wholeDigits within none
layout label splitDigits loopKind none
layout label splitDigits within none
layout label trailingZeros loopKind none
layout label trailingZeros within none
layout let at Int64 0 mutable
layout let power Int64 0 mutable
layout let sixteen Int64 16 immutable
layout let minusFour Int64 -4 immutable
layout let dot Byte 46 immutable
layout let zeroByte Byte 48 immutable
layout let one Int64 1 immutable
layout let letterE Byte 101 immutable
layout let zero Int64 0 immutable
layout let minusByte Byte 45 immutable
layout let plusByte Byte 43 immutable
layout let ten Int64 10 immutable
layout at begin set at start
layout at begin do smallCheck
layout at begin do largeCheck
layout at begin do exponentCheck
layout at begin branch if useExponent goto exponentForm else goto fixedForm
layout at exponentForm do firstDigit
layout at exponentForm set at afterFirst
layout at exponentForm do moreCheck
layout at exponentForm branch if more goto fraction else goto exponent
layout at fraction do writeDot
layout at fraction do findRest
layout at fraction do restCount
layout at fraction do writeRest
layout at fraction set at afterRest
layout at fraction goto exponent
layout at exponent do writeE
layout at exponent set at afterE
layout at exponent do powerOf
layout at exponent set power decimalPower
layout at exponent do negativeCheck
layout at exponent branch if negative goto minusSign else goto plusSign
layout at minusSign do writeMinus
layout at minusSign set at afterMinus
layout at minusSign do flip
layout at minusSign set power flipped
layout at minusSign goto twoDigits
layout at plusSign do writePlus
layout at plusSign set at afterPlus
layout at plusSign goto twoDigits
layout at twoDigits do oneDigitCheck
layout at twoDigits branch if oneDigit goto leadingZero else goto powerDigits
layout at leadingZero do writeLeading
layout at leadingZero set at afterLeading
layout at leadingZero goto powerDigits
layout at powerDigits do findPower
layout at powerDigits do writePower
layout at powerDigits do afterPower
layout at powerDigits return ok ended
layout at fixedForm do leadCheck
layout at fixedForm branch if noWhole goto leadingFraction else goto wholeDigits
layout at leadingFraction do writeZero
layout at leadingFraction do writePoint
layout at leadingFraction do zerosOf
