shapeQuotient is operation
shapeQuotient purpose "Set up a division: the work number is the number times 2^shift when shift is 0 or more, and the divisor the denominator times 2^-shift otherwise, then times 2^54 (for the check) or 2^53 (for the division, `last` -1)"
